# Implementation Plan — Master Data Model Refactoring (Eliminate Inconsistencies & Duplication)

Refactor the Hi-Profile data model and API payload layer to remove duplicate fields, repeated attributes, inconsistent naming conventions, and redundant nesting while establishing a single source of truth for every logical field.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **No Breaking Changes**: All raw provider responses (`rawData`) remain 100% untouched. Legacy field getters are provided on Mongoose schemas to ensure full backward compatibility with any existing MongoDB documents.

> [!NOTE]
> **Canonical Field Names**:
> - `profileImage` (replaces `profilePicture`, `avatarUrl`, `profilePicUrl`, `pictureUrl`)
> - `displayName` (replaces `fullName`, `channelName`, `name`)
> - `description` (replaces `bio`, `biography`, `summary`)
> - `followers` (consolidates `followersCount`, `subscribersCount`, `connectionsCount`)
> - `following` (consolidates `followingCount`)
> - `posts` (consolidates `postsCount`, `postCount`, `reposCount`, `videoCount`)
> - `recentContent` (single normalized array replacing `recentPosts`, `recentRepos`, `recentVideos`, `tweets`)

